zdisamar is an independent implementation of the O2 A radiative-transfer
problem used in DISAMAR-family validation studies. The Fortran DISAMAR project
is a scientific reference for validation; this repository does not include
DISAMAR source code.

The software source in this repository is licensed under the MIT License. The
tracked reference-data assets under data/reference_data/ are small scientific
datasets and derived subsets used for reproducible examples and validation.
Their provenance is documented in data/README.md and in the bundle manifests
stored next to the assets.
